{"id":"189150f03c9cdc63","group":"89","path":"89/89-cor-solovay-corollary.md","title":"Solovay Corollary","display":"cor-solovay-corollary — Solovay Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-cor-solovay-corollary","aliases":["89-cor-solovay-corollary"],"display":"cor-solovay-corollary — Solovay Corollary","depends_on":["[[89-thm-solovay]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-consistent-pa]]","[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-cor-solovay-corollary"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-cor-solovay-corollary</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-solovay-corollary — Solovay Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a196c7fa2f0957d2\" href=\"?note=a196c7fa2f0957d2\" title=\"89-thm-solovay\">89-thm-solovay</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c9363f0c1d91236\" href=\"?note=8c9363f0c1d91236\" title=\"89-df-consistent-pa\">89-df-consistent-pa</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8f382173effd5662\" href=\"?note=8f382173effd5662\" title=\"89-df-pa-provable-formula\">89-df-pa-provable-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> is the PA realization set,\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> the PA-provable-sentence set, and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> PA consistency.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}corollary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\;\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}corollary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\;\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL完全性的算术版本</li>\n<li>GL定理在所有解释下可证明</li>\n<li>Solovay定理的直接推论</li>\n<li>一致性前提与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a196c7fa2f0957d2\" href=\"?note=a196c7fa2f0957d2\" title=\"89-thm-solovay\">89-thm-solovay</a> 保持一致，避免不一致 PA 下右侧\n对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 都真。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-thm-solovay","status":"resolved","id":"a196c7fa2f0957d2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-solovay]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"1f581262c09d5e34","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-consistent-pa","status":"resolved","id":"8c9363f0c1d91236","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-consistent-pa]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-pa-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8f382173effd5662","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-solovay","status":"resolved","id":"a196c7fa2f0957d2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"一致性前提与 [[89-thm-solovay]] 保持一致，避免不一致 PA 下右侧\n对任意 $A$ 都真。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}corollary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\;\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1124,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["a196c7fa2f0957d2","1f581262c09d5e34","8c9363f0c1d91236","8f382173effd5662"]}